                '__assert_bcc__'
            [Constants]
                "Lets 'window' (a frameless QDialog/QWidget) be dragged by pressing and\n\tholding anywhere on 'card' (the dialog's outer frame), since these\n\twindows have no native title bar to drag by. Safe for the whole card,\n\tnot just a title strip: Qt delivers a mouse press to the topmost widget\n\tunder the cursor first, so buttons/comboboxes/line edits/checkboxes all\n\tconsume their own clicks for their own interaction and this handler\n\tnever sees them - only inert widgets (like a plain QLabel, which\n\tinstalls no handler of its own) and empty background bubble the press\n\tup to 'card', which is what actually handles the drag."
