            [Locals+Names]
                '__class__'
            [Constants]
                'WindowBorderOverlay'
                "Draws just the accent-colored rounded-rect border, raised above\n\tevery other child (including the title bar). MyWindow.paintEvent()\n\tonly fills the background now - a border painted there gets covered\n\tby any opaque child sitting on top of it (parents paint before their\n\tchildren), which is exactly what made the title bar hide the border's\n\ttop edge once it went flush to the window corners. Living up here\n\tinstead means it's never covered by anything. get_color is a callable\n\t(not a fixed value) so it stays live with accent-color changes with\n\tno extra sync plumbing needed elsewhere."
                '__pyarmor_assert_13012__'
