                10      STORE_NAME                      2: __qualname__
                12      LOAD_CONST                      1: 'Live view of the active device\'s physical mouse/keyboard monitor\n\tstream. Opened from the Engine tab\'s "Enable Monitoring" checkbox\n\t(KMBOX Net, KMBOX B+ or Ferrum - each streams or polls the state of\n\tthe physical mouse plugged into it, not what this app sends). Polls\n\t\'driver\'s monitor_buttons()/monitor_keys() on a timer since that\n\tstate is updated by a background thread or a query round-trip, not\n\tthrough Qt signals.\n\n\tButtons the mouse maps to keyboard keys show up in the keys line too\n\t(monitor_keys() names them, e.g. \'v\', \'b\') - mouse movement isn\'t\n\ttracked by any of the three drivers, so it isn\'t shown here.\n\n\t\'on_closed\' is called when the window is closed by the user (the X\n\tbutton), so the caller can uncheck its checkbox and stay in sync.'
